{% set m = momentum | default(0) -%}
{% if m >= 2 -%}
## momentum (engine-computed, advisory only)
MOMENTUM: HIGH (+{{ m }}). The player is on a strong run. Consider raising the stakes...

{% elif m <= -2 -%}
## momentum (engine-computed, advisory only)
MOMENTUM: LOW ({{ m }}). The player has been struggling. Unless the fiction demands
punishment, offer a small break...

{% endif -%}
{% if pending_gm_beat and pending_gm_beat.type -%}
GM DIRECTION ({{ pending_gm_beat.type | upper }}, surface as {{ pending_gm_beat.surface_as }}):
{{ pending_gm_beat.instruction }}
This is a backstage instruction, not player-visible narration. Integrate it naturally.

{% endif -%}
{% set scene_age = ((meta | default({})).turn | default(0)) - ((scene | default({})).turn_entered | default(0)) -%}
{% if scene_age >= 6 and not state.scene.scene_pressure -%}
SCENE AGE: This scene has been active for {{ scene_age }} turns with no location change.
Consider advancing: a new arrival, a change in atmosphere, a time skip, or a reason for the
player to move. Do not force it if the player's action anchors them here — but look for a
natural opportunity to shift.
{% elif scene_age >= 10 -%}
SCENE AGE: {{ scene_age }} turns in this location. The scene needs to move. Something should
change this turn: an NPC departs, conditions worsen, time pressure becomes visible.
{% endif -%}
